WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.066 --> 00:00:02.468
- OKAY, SO, OKAY,
BUT CHECK THIS OUT, OKAY?

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:05.038
SO THIS ONE TIME IN COLLEGE,
MAN, I WAS STRAIGHT KICKING GAME

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:07.206
TO THIS BEAUTIFUL CHICK,
DIANA, MAN?

00:00:07.239 --> 00:00:09.375
AND THE--IT'S A HOUSE PARTY,
AND SO ANYWAY,

00:00:09.408 --> 00:00:11.210
I GO TO THE KITCHEN TO GRAB US
A COUPLE OF BEERS, MAN.

00:00:11.243 --> 00:00:14.680
I KID YOU NOT,
I SLIPPED ON A BANANA PEEL.

00:00:14.713 --> 00:00:16.049
A BANANA PEEL.
IT WAS LIKE THIS.

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:20.987
I WAS LIKE--JUST FELL ON MY ASS.
I JUST BUSTED MY ASS.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.922
- A BANANA PEEL?

00:00:22.955 --> 00:00:23.890
- LIKE I WAS BUSTER KEATON
OR SOMETHING.

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:26.259
I WAS LIKE--
POO!

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:27.927
[laughter]

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:32.532
IT'S--UH--

00:00:33.966 --> 00:00:36.202
- YO--YO, DOG, YOU GOOD?

00:00:36.235 --> 00:00:40.540
- YEAH, MAN, WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:43.943
- WHAT, ME?

00:00:43.976 --> 00:00:46.712
IT WAS A FUNNY STORY.
I WAS LAUGHING.

00:00:46.745 --> 00:00:48.548
- THEN LET IT OUT, MAN.

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:51.084
JUST--JUST LAUGH.

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:52.885
- I AM.

00:00:52.918 --> 00:00:56.089
- YEAH, SO, ANYWAY, YOU KNOW,
SO I GET UP, RIGHT?

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:57.423
AND I GO TO GRAB A BEER,

00:00:57.456 --> 00:00:59.125
AND I FORGET THEY
ALL WAS SHOOKEN UP

00:00:59.158 --> 00:01:00.426
WHEN THEY FELL, RIGHT?

00:01:00.459 --> 00:01:04.130
I KID YOU NOT, THIS BEER
EXPLODED IN MY CROTCH,

00:01:04.163 --> 00:01:05.398
AND IT LOOKED
LIKE I PEED MYSELF.

00:01:05.431 --> 00:01:08.267
AND NOW I'M TRYING TO WALK,
BUT MY PANTS...

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:10.870
[laughter]

00:01:10.903 --> 00:01:13.306
COME ON, WHAT ARE WE DOING?

00:01:16.742 --> 00:01:18.611
- DON'T HIT--
- DON'T HIT MY COUCH, LARON.

00:01:18.644 --> 00:01:19.679
- KEEP YOUR--

00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:29.822
- COME ON, YO.
I'M JUST LAUGHING WITH Y'ALL.

00:01:29.855 --> 00:01:33.126
- WELL, WE WERE LAUGHING.

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:35.294
YOU WEREN'T--YOU DIDN'T,
YOU KNOW, MAKE ANY NOISE.

00:01:35.327 --> 00:01:38.965
YOU JUST OPENED YOUR MOUTH,
AND YOU STARTED JIGGLING.

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:40.466
- YOU LOOKED LIKE
A WORM ON CRACK.

00:01:40.499 --> 00:01:41.834
- MM-HMM.

00:01:41.867 --> 00:01:46.405
- I GUESS EVERYBODY JUST
HAS THEIR OWN UNIQUE LAUGH.

00:01:46.438 --> 00:01:48.407
- OKAY, MAN,
YOU WERE NOT LAUGHING.

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:50.743
YOU WERE NOT EMITTING SOUND
UP OUT YOUR MOUTH, MAN.

00:01:50.776 --> 00:01:52.745
- HEY, I'M GOOD.

00:01:52.778 --> 00:01:54.914
TELL YOUR STORY.

00:01:54.947 --> 00:01:57.517
- THANK YOU.
OKA--ANYWAY,

00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:01.320
I WENT BACK TO THE KITCHEN
TO GET TWO FRESH BEERS,

00:02:01.353 --> 00:02:03.823
AND SHE SAID, "I HATE BEER,

00:02:03.856 --> 00:02:07.326
BUT WHERE DID MY BANANA GO?"

00:02:07.359 --> 00:02:08.761
AND SO THEN
WE CALLED HER

00:02:08.794 --> 00:02:13.499
CHIQUITA DIANA.

00:02:13.532 --> 00:02:15.268
THERE HE GOES.

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:16.802
LARON, DON'T BACK UP.

00:02:16.835 --> 00:02:18.037
HEY.

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:20.106
- COME ON, MAN.
- CUT IT OUT, LARON.

00:02:20.139 --> 00:02:22.608
- HEY,
GET AWAY FROM THE TURTLES.

00:02:22.641 --> 00:02:24.877
LARON, DON'T DO THIS,
JUST DON'T TOUCH MY TUR--

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:26.512
[bleep], GET AWAY FROM IT.

00:02:26.545 --> 00:02:30.116
WHY YOU KNOCKING DOWN MY CDs?
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

00:02:30.149 --> 00:02:32.285
OKAY, YOU PUT A LAMPSHADE
ON YOUR HEAD?

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:33.686
HEY.
- COME ON.

00:02:33.719 --> 00:02:35.454
COME ON, THOSE ARE PRICELESS.
- OKAY, YOU KNOW WHAT?

00:02:35.487 --> 00:02:37.223
NOW I SAY, LIKE,
YOU DOING IT INTENTIONALLY, NOW.

00:02:37.256 --> 00:02:38.391
- ALL RIGHT, SEE?
THAT'S NOT EVEN--YOU KNOW,

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:40.126
IT'S ALMOST
LIKE YOU CHOREOGRAPHED IT.

00:02:40.159 --> 00:02:41.027
- YOU'RE GONNA
CLEAN ALL THIS UP.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.461
- OKAY.

00:02:42.494 --> 00:02:45.364
- LOOK, HEY, IF YOU'RE GONNA
LAUGH, THEN JUST LAUGH!

00:02:45.397 --> 00:02:48.168
DAMN.

00:02:50.903 --> 00:02:54.006
- MAYBE SOMETIMES

00:02:54.039 --> 00:02:57.643
YOU AIN'T AS FUNNY
AS YOU THINK.

00:02:57.676 --> 00:02:59.212
- ALL RIGHT.

00:02:59.245 --> 00:02:59.979
I GOT SOMETHING THAT'LL MAKE
YOU LAUGH.

00:03:00.012 --> 00:03:03.082
HUH?
BAP, HUH?

00:03:03.115 --> 00:03:04.917
- YEAH, JUST LET IT OUT.
- THERE YOU GO, LARON.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:05.985
- YEAH, THAT'S FUNNY.
- THAT'S IT, MAN.

00:03:06.018 --> 00:03:07.520
- JUST LET IT--OH, NO.

00:03:07.553 --> 00:03:11.224
THAT'S FUNNY, HUH?
- THERE YOU GO, MAN.

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:12.425
- OH! HE GOING BACKWARDS.
- COME ON, BUDDY.

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:13.926
JUST LAUGH, MAN, JUST LAUGH.
YOU KNOW THAT'S FUNNY.

00:03:13.959 --> 00:03:15.328
- THAT'S FUNNY!
- WHY WON'T YOU LAUGH?

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:17.029
- COME ON, JUST LET IT OUT.
- JUST LAUGH, BROTHER.

00:03:17.062 --> 00:03:18.564
COME ON, MAN.
- IT'S A ROBOT.

00:03:18.597 --> 00:03:22.235
- OH, MAN, LOOK, LOOK, LOOK.
- OH, OH, OH, OH, BOOP. BOOP.

00:03:22.268 --> 00:03:26.105
- LET IT OUT.
- BOOP.

00:03:26.138 --> 00:03:27.106
- LET IT OUT, LET IT OUT!

00:03:27.139 --> 00:03:28.774
- [screeching roar]

00:03:28.807 --> 00:03:30.876
[all screaming]

00:03:30.909 --> 00:03:33.713
[roaring continues]

00:03:35.881 --> 00:03:37.483
[roaring stops]

00:03:41.487 --> 00:03:45.959
- SEE, THAT'S WHY I DIDN'T
WANT TO LAUGH.

00:03:58.771 --> 00:03:59.904
HAVE A GOOD LIFE.

